            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 19:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naagarukamu ati: Njungire amahanga nk'arukujunga emizabbibbu, kandi busaho muntu n'omu ayaizire kunkoonyera, nkabajungisibwa ekiniga, esagama yabo nukwo kutaraakira engoye zange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkacwamu nti, akasumi ak'okujuna abantu bange kahikire; ako nuko akasumi ak'okufubira abanyanzigwa baabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.59.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 59:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkamagamaga, baitu hatabeho muntu n'omu ow'okunkoonyera; nkacwekwa enkizi, baitu hatabeho muntu n'omu kumpuumuza omukono gwange nugwo gumpaire obusinguzi, kandi ekiniga kyange nikyo kyangumize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiniga kyange nikyo kyandubaatiriize amahanga, nagacwacwana, esagama yabo nagiseesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba MUKAMA akagamba ati: Mazimakwo; bantu bange, baana abataliba ncwangya; nukwo kufooka Mujuni waabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kubonabonesibwa kwabo kwona, na uwe akabonabonesibwa hamu nabo, batajunwe mukwenda rundi malaika, baitu MUKAMA wonyini nuwe yabajunire. Akabajuna habw'engonzi ze na habw'embabazi ze; Yabaroleerraga ira lyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu bakamwemera, baasaaliza Mwoyo we Arukwera; na uwe nukwo kufooka munyanzigwa waabo; uwe wonyini yatandika kubarwanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma baijuka obusinge obwa ira obwa Musa omwiru wa MUKAMA, baayekaguza bati: MUKAMA ayajunire abeebembezi b'abantu be yabaiha omu nyanja ali nkaha? Ali nkaha ogu ayahaire musa Mwoyo we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kurug 14:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali nkaha ogu ayakoleze Musa ebintu ebihuuniriza, ayabaganiize amaizi g'enyanja, yayambura abantu amaizi amaingi, nukwo ayetungire okurangaanwa okwa buli na buli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'oha ayabambwire enyanja ataina bulemeezi, nk'embaraasi oku eraba omu irungu? Bateesitale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwoyo wa MUKAMA akabahuumuza, nk'ente ezirukusirimuka omu kihanga. Habweki, niwe wayebembiire abantu bawe, nukwo oyetungire ery'ekitiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyeme omwiguru, omukiikaro kyawe ekirukwera kandi eky'ekitiinisa, orole hansi okutuntuura kwawe kuraha? Obusobozi bwawe buraha? Engonzi n'embabazi zawe, biraha? Leka kutwihaho omutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, niiwe Isiitwe, noobwakubaire Abburahamu tatumanyire, Isirairi noobu araaba atarukutwikiriza; Iwe MUKAMA niiwe Isiitwe, niiwe watucungwire okuruga kara na kara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai MUKAMA, habwaki otuhabisa emihanda yawe, n'okutugumanganiza omutima, tukalema kukutiina? Garuka habw'abairu bawe, habw'enganda ez'obugwetwa bwawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itwe abantu bawe abarukwera, abanyanzigwa baitu bakatubinga okumara omwanya muke; baarubaatiira ekiikaro kyawe ekirukwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nootukora nk'atakabaga mulemi waitu, nkabatakabahoga bantu bawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
